### SKILL.md  [instructions]
+ - `scripts/build_pdf.py` — converts the generated Markdown manual to PDF (A3 landscape by default)
+ - `scripts/build_docx.py` — converts the generated Markdown manual to DOCX (Word, A3 landscape)
+ ## Output Formats
+ The skill supports **3 output formats** (ask the user which they want, default to PDF):
+ 1. **PDF** (A3 landscape) — best for reading, sharing, printing
+    - Built with reportlab + NotoSans
+    - Run: `python3 scripts/build_pdf.py output.pdf input.md`
+ 2. **DOCX / Word** (A3 landscape) — best for editing, customizing, copy-pasting sections
+    - Built with python-docx
+    - Run: `python3 scripts/build_docx.py output.docx input.md`
+ 3. **Both** — generate PDF + DOCX and deliver both
+ The user can also request:
+ - A4 portrait (default PDF/DOCX) — for short manuals
+ - A2 landscape (poster mode) — for workshop display
+ - Bilingual (English + Serbian) — for local markets

